'''The Face of God''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]]. [[Elder Flame Doron]] resides here, and can be unlocked as [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

After clearing all other Uncanny Legends sub-chapters on 1 Crown difficulty and unlocking [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]], the stage is invaded by [[Idi:Ne]] and becomes [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]], which reverts to normal when beaten.

