==Battleground==
*1 [[Elder Flame Doron]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*7 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*50 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[Elder Flame Doron]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*6 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 193.33 seconds<sup>5,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**3 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The best way to beat this stage is to stall out all of the Dorons while killing every Ragin' Gory that accompanies each spawn. Try to have each Doron miss as much as possible, as with each attack they land they will leave behind one of the longest lasting surges in the game that weakens your cats to 1% unless they're immune.

Doron isn't immune to [[Curse]], so a unit like [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli, Daughter of Chaos]] could be used to prevent your units from being crippled by Doron's Weaken.

===Recommended Units===
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]]: Boulder Cat can be used to bait out Doron's attacks and potentially make him miss. Boulder Cat can also act as some supplementary defense if Doron's surge causes you to lose a large amount of ground. If Doron misses, the surge will not spawn and your attackers will be safe.
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]: Pizza Cat does great against the Ragin' Gories here, dealing very high damage to them and being able to chip the SLOTH. However, Pizza gets outranged by the Owlbrows who deal very high damage, so be careful of that.
*[[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]: Bubble Cat does alright damage to Ragin' Gory and the SLOTH, and can easily kill Owlbrows even if they hide behind the Croconators, allowing you to refill your wallet without spending too much cash.

