==Trivia==
*The [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]] is notably absent from here, making [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]] the only themed Uncanny Legends sub-chapter not to use its gimmick in every stage.
**This may be because all the other stages that have the [[:Category:Enemy Cats|enemy variant]] of a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] in Uncanny Legends up to this point have had the same base design.
**This may also be because [[Elder Flame Doron]] already provides this stage with periodic Surges.
*The stage's name refers to how the Doron tribe's masks are made in the image of the gods who blessed them with their divine power; this is made more clear by the Japanese name, "Those Bestowed with the Face of a God" (神の面を賜りし者).
*From [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]], Elder Flame Doron's icon in the sub-chapter preview was replaced with an image error icon, despite it still being properly displayed in the stage preview.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] had a 3% drop chance from this stage.

